flowchart LR
  A[App uses library::Library] --> B[Library::with_options]
  B --> C[Create .bokheim dirs + SQLite DB]
  C --> D[DBConn::new initializes schema]
  B --> E[LibraryScanner::new]
  B --> F[SyncManager::new]
  B --> G{auto_sync_enabled?}
  G -->|yes| H[Spawn tokio thread]
  H --> I[sync_once -> sync loop]

  B --> J[start_background_scan_and_watch]
  J --> K[scan_library]
  K --> L[WalkDir filesystem]
  L --> M[upsert_dir / insert_book / insert_local_book_dir]
  M --> N[commit transaction]
  N --> O[get_books_without_title]
  O --> P[epub::get_epub_id_and_title]
  P --> Q[update_book_title]

  A --> R[Library APIs]
  R --> S[get_dir_contents -> DB]
  S --> T[home::get_thumbnail]

  F --> U[sync_with_server]
  U --> V[push_local_events]
  U --> W[pull_events_from_server]
  U --> X[sync_assets]
  X --> Y[transfer::run_transfer_workers]
  Y --> Z[Upload/Download books + thumbnails]
  Z --> AA[DB updates + LibraryEvent]

  subgraph home.rs
    HB[get_app_data_dir] --> HC[create_library/get_libraries]
    HC --> HD[libraries.csv]
  end

  subgraph "DB interactions"
    UIA[UI / Library API] --> DBA[SQLite DB]
    SCAN[LibraryScanner] --> DBA
    SYNC[SyncManager] --> DBA
  end

  UIA -->|Read dir contents / book metadata| DBA
  UIA -->|Update reading position / last read| DBA

  SCAN -->|Upsert dirs| DBA
  SCAN -->|Insert books + book_dir| DBA
  SCAN -->|Update book titles| DBA

  SYNC -->|Read sync state| DBA
  SYNC -->|Apply remote events| DBA
  SYNC -->|Mark uploaded/downloaded + metadata| DBA
